at is used later","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"within the musical data. Since parts may be encoded separately and combined later, identification elements are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"present at both the score and score-part levels. There must be at least one score-part, combined as desired","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with part-group elements that indicate braces and brackets. Parts are ordered from top to bottom in a score","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"based on the order in which they appear in the part-list.","type":"text"}],"title":"MXLPartList","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPartList","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlpartlist","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLPartList"}],"role":"symbol"}}}